{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旺角發生傷人案，一名男子在梯間遇襲受傷，清醒送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">案發後，多名警員搜索兇徒蹤影。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING.MK-0330.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026YOoZ8gLFkt1785279110.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING.MK-0330.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場為亞皆老街52號後巷，一幢大廈的後樓梯間，事發在凌晨二時許。現場消息指，35歲男事主是內地人，他懷疑到上址召妓，與一名跨性別性工作者，就收費問題起爭執，之後遇襲，頸部受刀傷。事主走出大廈坐在行人路，由途人報警，警方列作傷人案處理，警方正追緝一名，年約20至35的人士。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING.MK-0330_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026zxMSUcCBoJ1785279091.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WOUNDING.MK-0330_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T08:21:20.616579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}